# Job board project rules

This is an aggregator for internships and new-grad / early-career jobs at **large companies across industries**, not a tech-only board.

Data flow is one way: GitHub JSON feeds and public ATS job-board JSON -> normalize -> dedupe -> Postgres -> FastAPI -> React. The website never fetches GitHub or company boards live.

- Keep fetch / normalize / dedupe / store / serve in separate modules.
- Prefer public JSON job-board APIs (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workday CXS). Do not HTML-scrape career pages or log in.
- Company names alone are not a source. `backend/data/companies.json` needs an ATS board slug or career URL.
- Company-board pulls keep intern / new-grad / early-career titles only.
- Config via env vars. Never commit secrets. `date_posted` is a real datetime.
- Sync must isolate per-feed and per-company failures. Do not delete stale jobs; mark `active=false`.
- If you would deviate from `PROJECT.md`, ask first.
